1. Start.
2. Input the student's name, aggregate marks, minimum subject marks, attendance percentage, and annual family income.
3. Check whether all eligibility conditions are satisfied:
   - Aggregate marks ≥ 75%
   - Minimum subject marks ≥ 60%
   - Attendance ≥ 75%
   - Annual family income ≤ ₹2,50,000
4. If all conditions are satisfied, declare the student eligible; otherwise, declare the student not eligible.
5. Display the result.
6. Stop.
